<title>USA: Prudential in co-venture to buy Baltimore hotel.</title>
<headline>Prudential in co-venture to buy Baltimore hotel.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Insurance Co of America affiliate Prudential Real Estate Investors said it will join with Chick Hill of Davidson Hotel Co to buy and operate the historic Lord Baltimore Hotel.</p>
<p>No purchase price was disclosed for the 419-room hotel near Baltimore's Inner Harbor area, which will become a Hilton Hotels Corp franchise managed by Davidson under a joint venture with Prudential.</p>
<p>Prudential is in five other joint ventures with Hill, who is president of Davidson Hotel in Memphis, Tenn.</p>
